  "details": "   * CVE-2026-31602\n     - ALSA: ctxfi: Limit PTP to a single page {CVE-2026-31602}\n   * CVE-2026-43241\n     - ntb: ntb_hw_switchtec: Fix array-index-out-of-bounds access\n       {CVE-2026-43241}\n   * CVE-2026-23281\n     - wifi: libertas: fix use-after-free in lbs_free_adapter() {CVE-2026-23281}\n   * CVE-2025-71116\n     - libceph: make decode_pool() more resilient against corrupted osdmaps\n       {CVE-2025-71116}\n   * CVE-2022-49892\n     - ftrace: Fix use-after-free for dynamic ftrace_ops {CVE-2022-49892}\n   * CVE-2022-3625\n     - devlink: Fix use-after-free after a failed reload {CVE-2022-3625}\n   * CVE-2022-50552\n     - blk-mq: use quiesced elevator switch when reinitializing queues\n       {CVE-2022-50552}\n   * CVE-2026-31581\n     - ALSA: 6fire: fix use-after-free on disconnect {CVE-2026-31581}\n   * CVE-2025-68366\n     - nbd: defer config unlock in nbd_genl_connect {CVE-2025-68366}\n   * CVE-2026-43203\n     - atm: fore200e: fix use-after-free in tasklets during device removal\n       {CVE-2026-43203}\n   * CVE-2026-23361\n     - PCI: dwc: ep: Flush MSI-X write before unmapping its ATU entry\n       {CVE-2026-23361}\n   * CVE-2025-71082\n     - Bluetooth: btusb: revert use of devm_kzalloc in btusb {CVE-2025-71082}\n   * CVE-2025-71199\n     - iio: adc: at91-sama5d2_adc: Fix potential use-after-free in sama5d2_adc\n       driver {CVE-2025-71199}\n   * CVE-2026-31626\n     - staging: rtl8723bs: initialize le_tmp64 in rtw_BIP_verify()\n       {CVE-2026-31626}\n   * CVE-2026-43427\n     - usb: class: cdc-wdm: fix reordering issue in read code path\n       {CVE-2026-43427}\n   * CVE-2025-71136\n     - media: adv7842: Avoid possible out-of-bounds array accesses in\n       adv7842_cp_log_status() {CVE-2025-71136}\n   * CVE-2026-31780\n     - wifi: wilc1000: fix u8 overflow in SSID scan buffer size calculation\n       {CVE-2026-31780}\n   * CVE-2026-43052\n     - wifi: mac80211: check tdls flag in ieee80211_tdls_oper {CVE-2026-43052}\n   *